an=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/01/29/79683856/ea83fc1ab3d44a7cb541fadea9fb5cd5_4697340843953599229.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">410</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">41</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">她追寻着理想的倒影，如赤足奔跑的孩童。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">越过苍茫的田野，越过遥远的星天。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">那倒影是如此清晰，如此遥远，岿然不动。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">她看向自己的倒影，于是发现了与理想同样珍贵之物———</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">那就是追寻本身。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"valkyrie\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-valkyrie obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器展示</h2> <ul data-target=\"skill.items\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn-list\"><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn obc-tmpl__switch-btn--active\">\n      初始外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      满星外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      实机展示\n    </li></ul> <ul data-target=\"skill.items\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-list\" style=\"height: 634px;\"><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-val