 data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/21/77124895/fd8d60c9384cf68753d217888ada26f7_6992928060680941047.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>速射弩</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/12/02/50494840/0508d2fe82a05e81dcf432f89ea1d124_8049432544582326957.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"width:775px;vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">不息求索</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">同调(I&nbsp;/II&nbsp;/III)阶</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">全队角色全元素伤害提高<strong>(<span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">4.0%/8.0%/12.0%</span>)</strong>，敌人受到来自武器技攻击的全元素伤害提高<strong>(<span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">3.0%/6.0%/9.0%</span>)</strong>（唯一生效）</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">于碧空之上</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span></strong>武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">武器技攻击命中后使自身全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">3.5%</span></strong>，持续1.5秒，最多叠加10次，重复触发刷新持续时间</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">于深林之中</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">雷电元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">35.0%</span></strong>，<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>状态期间武器技雷电元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">25.0%</span></strong>。 女武神·巡矢使用时，<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>定准轰击</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;定准轰击&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;技能：&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;急速射击&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;过程中，当&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;速射动能&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;低于阈值时，点按武器技键触发的强力一击&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>命中的敌人受到的雷电元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">16.0%</span></strong>，持续25秒，重复触发刷新持续时间</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">于煦阳之下</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">武器技命中敌人后，全队角色全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">12.0%</span></strong>，持续25秒，重复触发刷新持续时间（唯一生效）。女武神·巡矢使用时，<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>定准轰击</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;定准轰击&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;技能：&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;急速射击&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;过程中，当&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;速射动能&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;低于阈值时，点按武器技键触发的强力一击&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>引发7次连环爆炸，每次造成<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">200.0%</span></strong>攻击力的雷电元素伤害，该伤害对仅受到固定伤害的护盾额外造成<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">2.0</span></strong>点伤害</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/3063/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/01/29/79683856/5eaf2171e7fcc6b105bafc18d22c9e99_5570624299738229166.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">获得「电光飞弧」后解锁锻造</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">