%83%E8%BD%BB%E6%9D%BE%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%98%93%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%9B%E8%80%8C%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E5%85%A8%E9%98%9F%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22img%22%3A%22%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1706712524154\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/01/31/79683856/32d76afed4c3b70c3ab0b0963efdde29_5932892627494560883.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>女武神·巡矢</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">最佳推荐武器，大幅提高角色的输出和辅助能力。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">兼具输出与辅助能力的武器。女武神·巡矢使用时对【速射重击】进行额外强化，配合高速连击能够快速摧毁仅受到固定伤害的护盾，大大提高了角色的破盾能力。同调技能提供常驻的全队增益；同时，女武神·巡矢在循环中武器技使用较为频繁，能够比较轻松的触发武器的易伤，进而提高全队的输出。</p></div> <!----></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
